{"publicId":"d0366655-fe26-4394-9fde-5df9980cac13","title":"Cornell实验室首次利用海底光纤电缆检测北极露脊鲸高频叫声","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T00:20:02.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-11T00:20:02.000Z","digest":"Cornell实验室通过分析Quintillion公司海底光纤电缆的数TB数据，首次在分布式声学传感（DAS）中检测到北极露脊鲸150-300赫兹的高频叫声【新】。该技术突破传统声学监测的地理限制，Bouffaut称其或能用于估算须鲸种群数量、追踪迁徙规律及研究北极鲸类对快速环境变化的适应【新】。研究仅基于Quintillion公司特定电缆数据，未明确说明检测范围是否覆盖整个北极海域或样本时间跨度。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-11T00:38:30.969Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Cornell 实验室首次验证分布式声学传感技术可捕捉弓头鲸高频叫声","latestReport":{"id":"mrsq7krjvjxfambsxhetz0ft1"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fLelQCQPgJYk","title":"首次利用光纤电缆技术检测北极露脊鲸的高频叫声","firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T00:20:02.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"mrsq7krjvjxfambsxhetz0ft1","title":"Cornell 实验室首次验证分布式声学传感技术可捕捉弓头鲸高频叫声","summary":"Bouffaut 团队通过分析 Quintillion 公司海底光纤电缆的数TB数据，首次在分布式声学传感（DAS）数据中检测到弓头鲸（Balaenoptera bowhead）150-300赫兹的高频叫声。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T00:20:02.000Z","selected":true}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"mrsq7krjvjxfambsxhetz0ft1","title":"Cornell 实验室首次验证分布式声学传感技术可捕捉弓头鲸高频叫声","summary":"Bouffaut 团队通过分析 Quintillion 公司海底光纤电缆的数TB数据，首次在分布式声学传感（DAS）数据中检测到弓头鲸（Balaenoptera bowhead）150-300赫兹的高频叫声。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T00:20:02.000Z","selected":true}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z","heat":9.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T02:00:00.000Z","heat":9.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T03:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T04:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T06:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T07:00:00.000Z","heat":8.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T08:00:00.000Z